    "title": "Requirements",
    "body": "A shopping app with 50 million users sends push, email and SMS. Requirements: (F1) notify users about events such as \"order shipped\" and login codes; (F2) send promotional campaigns of up to 10 million emails; (F3) respect opt-outs and quiet hours at the moment of sending, also on retries and fallbacks. (N1) Order updates handed to the provider within 1 minute and login codes within 30 seconds, even during a campaign; (N2) never exceed a provider's quota; (N3) a notification reaches a user at most once per channel, and through a fallback channel only after the first channel definitely failed. Login codes are the stated exception: a rare duplicate code is better than a missing one.",
