    "title": "How long is a campaign?",
    "body": "The email provider accepts **1,000 emails per second**. A campaign of 10 million emails therefore takes 10,000,000 ÷ 1,000 = **10,000 seconds, about 2.8 hours**, even if everything else is instant. Transactional traffic is about 20 million a day, about 230 per second on average. If both share one queue, every \"order shipped\" email waits behind the campaign for up to 2.8 hours.",
