  {
    "title": "Quotas and priority",
    "body": "The email pacer sends at most **1,000 per second**, counting retries (SD 17). It always takes transactional messages first and keeps **200 per second** for them; the campaign uses the other 800, about 10,000,000 ÷ 800 = 12,500 seconds, about 3.5 hours, a little longer with its retries. Transactional email peaks at about **150 per second**, retries included, below the 200 kept, so its queue never builds up and each message is handed to the provider within seconds. When transactional traffic is low, the campaign may use the spare room.",
